    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "These files allow for the reproducibility of the analysis in the manuscript \"Blue whales increase feeding rates at fine-scale ocean features\". \r\nrawData.zip includes files and folders that comprise the raw data used in the manuscript \r\nModels.zip contains the Generalized Linear Mixed Effects Models produced in the analysis of the manuscript",
